[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 32181.51, "timestamp": "08:56:21", "text": "12。呃，昨天62是12。63是13。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 32184.11, "timestamp": "08:56:24", "text": "我得到了比利比利。發生了什麼事"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 32194.548, "timestamp": "08:56:34", "text": "？我睡覺了。晚安，各位。我的天啊。我得睡覺了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 32198.07, "timestamp": "08:56:38", "text": "。我其實要去睡覺了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 32214.07, "timestamp": "08:56:54", "text": "[音樂]"}]